# Documentation

- README is the only long-form project doc. Do not create a `docs/` folder unless
  the user explicitly asks
- Update README when tasks, setup steps, or user-facing workflows change
- Keep AGENTS.md short: point to README and `.cursor/rules`; do not duplicate
  long manuals there
- Prefer tables and concrete commands over prose
- Match the repo voice: direct, no em dashes
